<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli artillery and airstrikes continue hitting southern Lebanese towns such as Wadi Zibqin while Hezbollah persists in firing and is expanding its arsenal, including reported shipments to Yemen. Israel has reallocated $90 million from border-community recovery budgets to defense and is delaying completion of the Lebanon border wall. US sanctions on Hezbollah affiliates are viewed as having limited impact, and Iran is reported to be developing chemical weapons. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxORXc3TElhdHlmNHBCbEVqbVo4Tk9LZ3RaSXpjQ0tiQzllQWJXXzViTDF3cVYzLWFBM0NpQTFLclZxWDhXTlYzMFd3enJzRzNERjNCZkRNZDZFQ0hCbzhSNUhwS3Z6ejBoNFFaZHpSLTVCT1RhTV9PdHVsUW5lT2pieXdkNnAyRkp0SUdPdXFzUnp3VW8tX25mdnota2szbzR5Wm9rLXVjQ2pDZTUwcWRsSWd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
